---

import '../styles/global.css';   
---

<section class="bg-pine text-white py-[68px]">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-5">
        <div class="text-center" data-anim>
          <div class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-gold mb-3.5">The real cost of waiting</div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white mb-3.5">What Your CRM Decision <em class="not-italic text-gold">Actually Costs You</em></h2>
          <p class="max-w-[58ch] mx-auto mb-10 text-[#E0C8C4] text-[16.5px]">Advisors on Quivr report saving 2–3 hours of admin per week. At a typical advisor's hourly value, here's the math.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="overflow-x-auto mx-auto max-w-[940px]" data-anim>
          <table class="w-full text-sm min-w-[640px] border-collapse">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-white/5 border-b border-white/12 text-[12px] tracking-wider uppercase text-[#E8CFCB]">
                <th class="p-3.5 text-left font-bold">Your move</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 text-left font-bold">Hours lost weekly</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 text-left font-bold">Annual cost*</th>
                <th class="p-3.5 text-left font-bold">What you're risking</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr class="bg-gold/14 border-b border-white/12">
                <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-gold">✅ Switch now with guided migration</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">Recover 2–3 hrs</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">Hours back: ~100–150/yr</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">Nothing. Team aligned, clients served, firm scaling.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-white/12">
                <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-[#F4E6E3]">😬 Keep limping on your current CRM</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">2–3 hrs lost</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">~$20,000–$30,000 in advisor time</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">A slow bleed, every week, forever.</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="border-b border-white/12">
                <td class="p-3.5 font-bold text-[#F4E6E3]">🔥 Stay on spreadsheets &amp; memory</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">4+ hrs lost</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">$30,000+ plus missed follow-ups</td>
                <td class="p-3.5">Dropped client commitments. The trust you can't rebuild.</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <p class="text-center text-[17px] font-semibold max-w-[56ch] mx-auto mt-7 text-[#F4E6E3]" data-anim>
          Your CRM is a <b class="text-gold font-bold">one-week migration</b> that becomes a <b class="text-gold font-bold">$25,000-a-year problem</b> if you keep waiting.
        </p>

        <div class="max-w-[820px] mx-auto mt-10 bg-white text-text rounded-2xl p-7 md:p-[32px] text-center" data-anim="scale">
          <h3 class="text-2xl sm:text-[30px] font-black leading-tight">Complete turnkey migration, in under a week</h3>
          <div class="w-[56px] h-1 bg-gold rounded-full mx-auto my-3"></div>
          <p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-dim mb-5.5">Intro call · Migration plan · Workflows customized with the Quivr team</p>
          
          <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5 mb-5.5 text-left">
            <div class="bg-paper-dim rounded-lg p-4">
              <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M14.7 6.3a4 4 0 0 0-5.4 5.4L4 17l3 3 5.3-5.3a4 4 0 0 0 5.4-5.4l-2.6 2.6-2.1-2.1 2.7-2.5z"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-[14.5px] font-bold mb-1">Truly turnkey</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-dim">Clients, notes, tasks, history: the Quivr team moves it all. You don't lift a finger.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-paper-dim rounded-lg p-4">
              <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 4.5-3 8.5-7 10-4-1.5-7-5.5-7-10V6l7-3z"/><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4.5"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-[14.5px] font-bold mb-1">Built on Salesforce</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-dim">Institutional-grade security and reliability, with none of the configuration burden.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-paper-dim rounded-lg p-4">
              <div class="w-[38px] h-[38px] rounded-[9px] bg-gold-tint text-gold-deep flex items-center justify-center mb-2.5 shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="6" y="4" width="12" height="17" rx="2"/><path d="M9 4a3 3 0 0 1 6 0"/><path d="M9 11h6M9 15h4"/></svg>
              </div>
              <h4 class="text-[14.5px] font-bold mb-1">No consultant traps</h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-text-dim">Workflows built with you by people who sit in your chair. CFPs and ops pros.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <a class="inline-block bg-red text-white font-extrabold rounded-lg px-8 py-3.75 text-base hover:bg-[#5C1010] transition-colors" href="#leadForm">Claim Your Intro Call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>